# Suggest a skill or a rule

After a user prompt that we will clearly repeat (conventions, infra commands, lesson format, teaching style), pause and propose one of:

- **Rule** — standing constraint, short, always-on or glob-scoped (`.cursor/rules/*.mdc`)
- **Skill** — repeatable procedure with steps (`.cursor/skills/*/SKILL.md`)
- **Neither** — one-off; do not create files

Say why in one sentence. Create the file only after the user agrees. Do not nag on every message; only when the pattern will recur.
